+@item LATM                      @tab X @tab X
+@item LMLM4                     @tab   @tab X
+    @tab Used by Linux Media Labs MPEG-4 PCI boards
+@item LOAS                      @tab   @tab X
+    @tab contains LATM multiplexed AAC audio
+@item LRC                       @tab X @tab X
